#: templates/core/styleguide.html:25
msgid "Light table"
msgstr "Svetlomiza"

#: templates/core/styleguide.html:37
msgid ""
"Event types take their colour from the ColorChecker Classic chart "
"photographers calibrate with. The colour sits in a bar; text stays neutral, "
"so contrast never depends on the hue."
msgstr "Vrste dogodkov dobijo barve iz tablice ColorChecker Classic, s katero fotografi umerjajo barve. Barva je v pasu ob robu, besedilo ostane nevtralno, zato kontrast ni nikoli odvisen od odtenka."

#: templates/core/styleguide.html:50
msgid "Typography"
msgstr "Tipografija"

#: templates/core/styleguide.html:59
msgid "for display, Hanken Grotesk for the interface."
msgstr "za naslove, Hanken Grotesk za vmesnik."

#: templates/core/styleguide.html:61
msgid ""
"Secondary text, 14 px. Used for supporting details, never for anything that "
"has to be read to act."
msgstr "Drugotno besedilo, 14 px. Za dodatne podrobnosti, nikoli za nekaj, kar morate prebrati, da lahko ukrepate."

